      "content": "but it isn't just about wanting noise. it's more like... i've done everything right to protect myself, but there's still this constant ache. i feel like i'm just waiting for something that's never coming. everything feels so permanent and stuck. i'm just tired of fighting to stay in a room that isn't even making me happy anymore.",
